## 10. Exact commands for the integrator

From the repository root (`/Users/lucafantini/Desktop/Personal/Padel-3D/steam-circuit-padel-godot`),
in an **isolated copy** (the author's wave ran no Godot process; a user game process was alive
during implementation and must not be disturbed):

```sh
# 0. isolated copy — do not run the audit inside the user's live checkout
rsync -a --exclude '.git' --exclude '.godot' . /tmp/uir08-run/ && cd /tmp/uir08-run

# 1. the HUD audit (UIR-08's own evidence)
/Applications/Godot.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot --headless --path godot/ \
  --script res://tests/ui/hud_audit.gd
# expect: every `hud/...` check ok, exit 0

# 2. the lane's existing audits must be unchanged by this wave
/Applications/Godot.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot --headless --path godot/ \
  --script res://tests/ui/router_audit.gd
/Applications/Godot.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot --headless --path godot/ \
  --script res://tests/ui/data_audit.gd

# 3. the frozen surfaces this wave must not have touched
/Applications/Godot.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot --headless --path godot/ \
  --script res://tests/game_slice_test.gd

# 4. record the audit output next to this file
#    (evidence/uir-08-hud-audit-run.log — the run log for GATE-A)
```

If step 1 fails, the failure text names the check, its expected and actual values, and the
sample or region involved; §9 lists what each group means.

