## 11. Open items

* Execution: this wave's prototype has never been instantiated by Godot. §10 is the whole
  verification path.
* GATE-A visual verdict is still open, and no post-gate screens may be produced from this wave;
  the capture states exist so UIR-24's harness can produce the frame set afterwards.
* Mounting (UIR-09) is untouched by design; the HUD is built to be mountable
  (`refresh`, `bind_names`, `apply_safe_area`, `panels`, `report`) but is not in the router.
* The theme requests in §7 are the only colour/shape gaps; all of them are recorded at their
  point of use, none is worked around with a literal or a per-node override.
